{
  "version": "0.8.0",
  "last_updated": "2026-07-30",
  "verification_target": "B42.20",
  "description": "Module path -> global name redirects for PZ B42. v0.8.0 re-validates the whole set against an installed B42.20 Stable rather than against changelogs: every target global was checked for a top-level assignment in an auto-loaded media/lua file, with projectzomboid.jar checked as a fallback for Java-exposed globals (BodyLocations is the worked example, no lua assignment anywhere but a real runtime global from zombie/characters/WornItems/BodyLocations). 133 of the 137 previously shipped redirects still resolve. CharacterCustomisationPanel and CommonTemplates were confirmed removed upstream and demoted to unrecoverable. Vehicles/VehicleUtils was promoted out of unrecoverable (the old note conflated a missing file with a missing global). Added 4 redirects: gamepadBinding (the one genuinely new 42.20 move, per changelog), plus TimedActions/ISWalkToTimedAction, ISUI/ISItemDropBox and Items/ProceduralDistributions/ProceduralDistributions, all three observed failing in a real 42.20 session log. The Animals Everywhere and ContainerButtons candidates staged in v0.7.0 were resolved against the install and shipped. v0.8.0 also diffs the 42.19 community lua mirror (Project-Zomboid-Community-Modding/ProjectZomboid-Vanilla-Lua, commit 29df4fe) against the installed 42.20, which is the first time this project has had a true build-to-build file diff instead of a changelog reading. That diff confirms gamepadBinding as the only root move (shared -> client), surfaces one removal the changelog never mentions (Farming/BuildingObjects/ISFarmingCursor), and proves CharacterCustomisationPanel and CommonTemplates were already gone by 42.19.",
